{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e259","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08707-ceef-7493-9b49-24effd76d285"},"sequence":3975,"recorded_at":1780531400007945,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"89c3b30b-a554-4b21-8bbd-183ab5ebf7c3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"89c3b30b-a554-4b21-8bbd-183ab5ebf7c3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"89c3b30b-a554-4b21-8bbd-183ab5ebf7c3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"0fc37cf4-7229-439b-8d2b-34456d3f0a20"},"task_id":"0fc37cf4-7229-439b-8d2b-34456d3f0a20","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"0fc37cf4-7229-439b-8d2b-34456d3f0a20","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-09\n-\n-### TASK-260908-3kvnm2: adopted signed v0.6.0 normative source alongside v0.5.0, no consumer re-pointed\n+## 2026-09-09\n+\n+### TASK-260908-2tkufa: catalog, registry, CI and traceability consume adopted v0.6.0; 13 new sections mapped, runtime stays uncovered\n+- REWIRE (this session): `cataloggen.Generate` verifies the v0.6.0 lock and derives all three projections (`catalog.v0.6.0.json` source, reviewed metadata digest `5788d45d…87b963`); `catalog.Current` serves v0.6.0 (63 rows) with `ForRelease` V050/V043 projections preserved; cigate roots are v0.6.0 current / v0.4.3 historical with pin reads via `CurrentV060`; traceability verifies the v0.6.0 lock, metadata, `LoadV060` document and V060 inventory plus an in-gate v0.5.0 legacy projection check (`ownership.v0.6.0.json`, digest `81a29888…65be`). `specpin.Current`/`Verify` stay v0.5.0; `localstore` now binds history explicitly through new `CurrentV050`.\n+- OWNERS (13 new sections, no runtime claimed): owned `6.6`->config `Migrate`, `11.10`->catalog `ForRelease`, `14.7`->cliresult `Emit`, each unevidenced with a gap naming the unimplemented remainder; unowned disclosures for `11.10.1-11.10.5`, `14.7.1/14.7.2/14.7.3/14.7.4/14.7.5`. Structured Error 1.4.0 codes deliberately excluded from the catalog error vocabulary: `axerror` is closed over 1.0-1.3 and minting the codes would panic every consumer at init (verified by reading `mustBuildCodeRegistry`); the 1.4.0 contract version is adopted at census level and §14.7.3 is disclosed unowned. The 17 legacy clause lines migrated 1:1 (probe-verified excerpts).\n+- FORCED config parity (out-of-listed-scope but directly required): the catalog census now advertises Configuration 4.0.0, so catalog-derived config tests demanded it. `Decode`/`Migrate` behavior unchanged (4.0.0 documents/targets still refused — a pre-existing `schema_test.go` row already pinned `Load(\"4.0.0\")` refusal as \"unsupported major\"). Added `config.Version4` label plus assessment-only admission (`assessmentVersion`) so `AssessCompatibility` reasons over 4.0.0 pairs, and refusal arms (not translations) in the three version-enumerating tests, citing SPEC §6.6 refusal semantics. A 4.0.0 reader/migration remains dependent-leaf work.\n+- EVIDENCE: battery `/tmp/tkufa-mut/battery.sh` in isolated copy (pristine control green, byte-exact restore verified): 7 narrowing mutants killed — M1 lock-fallback kills `TestGenerateRefusesStaleV050Authority`, M2 stale-pin-current kills `TestCheckReleaseRootsRefusesDrift`, M3 stale-lock-fallback kills `TestVerifyRepositoryRefusesStaleV050Lock`, M4 stale-current kills `TestCurrentMatchesReviewedV060Catalog`, M5 selector-exemption kills the selector refusal test plus the narrowed-ownership subtest dropping the same key, M6 token-preserving stale directive passes the token checker but fails `go generate` freshness with no partial write, M7 Decode-admits-4.0.0 kills the three new refusal arms plus the pre-existing \"unsupported major\" row. `go test ./...` green, `-cover` green (touched pkgs 79-100%), `go vet` + `GOOS=windows vet/build` exit 0, gofmt/`git diff --check` clean. Measured report: 63/36/101/32/55, bindings 56 (1/3/1/48/3), unowned 12, clauses 17/463.\n+- SCOPE: `internal/{catalog,cataloggen,cigate,traceability}/**`, `internal/{specpin,specdoc,localstore}` (alias/binding/comments only), `internal/config/{schema,migration}.go` + two test files (assessment admission + refusal arms only, zero decoder/migration behavior change), `README.md`, `LOGBOOK.md` (this entry). No `axerror`/`cliresult`/decoder production change; no `.github` change (sibling scope). Work left uncommitted in the worktree for board CR.\n+- STATUS: handed to review, work left uncommitted in the worktree for board CR.\n+\n+### TASK-260908-3kvnm2: adopted signed v0.6.0 normative source alongside v0.5.0, no consumer re-pointed\n"}}}
